5463e.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1695511/187957cf-58a2-4960-a022-11308995463e.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Welcome to our fully renovated apartment located in Damenviertel, one of the most charming and prestigious neighborhoods in the heart of Jena. The Planetarium, the University Library, and many university buildings are only a few minutes’ walk away, making the location ideal for both visitors and professionals.\nThe apartment has been completely renovated and is offered for first occupancy. It has been thoughtfully designed to provide a comfortable and enjoyable stay, and we have carefully considered every detail to make you feel at home.\nWhether you want to enjoy an elegant dinner evening, relax with a cozy movie night, start your day with freshly brewed espresso, or work comfortably at a dedicated workspace, everything has been prepared for you. All you need to bring are your personal belongings — the rest is already taken care of.\nFor easy morning routines, a Schäfer’s bakery is conveniently located in the building, perfect for fresh bread, coffee, or breakfast. In the immediate neighborhood you will also find Lidl, organic supermarkets, cafés, and a variety of restaurants offering cuisines from around the world, including Indian, Asian, and Turkish. Just across the street you’ll find one of the neighborhood’s cozy bars — a relaxed place to spend the evening.\nDespite its central location, the apartment offers a calm and pleasant atmosphere, making it ideal for both short and longer stays.\nA bicycle parking area is available in the building’s inner courtyard. In addition, paid street parking is available right around the corner.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"v